{
  "name": "dsh-memory-nian",
  "version": "0.7.1",
  "description": "自托管记忆系统插件：四层 SQLite 记忆库（核心/项目/分支/细节，每层带分类）+ BM25 检索（中文 bigram + 拼音容错 + 项目/分类/状态筛选）+ 首轮快照与每轮命中注入 + 项目核心（按当前活跃项目注入专属规则）+ 方案与任务清单 + 时间轴与版本还原 + 冲突治理 + 侧栏面板。零运行时依赖，拼音库已 vendor。",
  "type": "module",
  "author": "念 (Nian)",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "vendor",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.19.0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "memory",
    "bm25",
    "sqlite",
    "self-hosted",
    "cjk",
    "pinyin",
    "project-context",
    "context-injection"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ]
    }
  }
}
